{"course":{"format":"FlightCourse.v3","id":"native-pursuit-armor-windows","revision":"r1","environment":"stadium","locales":{"en":{"title":"Armor Windows","brief":"Shield front contact and a braced trooper damage the hull. Use the shield’s sides or rear and the trooper’s recovery.","lesson":"Native pursuit. All required targets are finite. Use manual flight controls and touch the torso. Unarmed targets do not fire; armor has visible contact rules. Optional courier catches are recorded separately without quota credit."},"uk":{"title":"Вікна броні","brief":"Наземне переслідування з ручним керуванням польотом. Спостерігайте за намірами цілей та обирайте шлях перехоплення.","lesson":"Цілі скінченні й неозброєні. Торкайтеся тулуба. Бігун тікає, спринтер попереджає про ривок, пара шукає зустріч. Щит захищає спереду; боєць відкритий під час відновлення. Необов’язковий кур’єр обліковується окремо без заліку цілі."}},"spawn":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":14000},"bounds":{"min":{"x":-18000,"y":0,"z":-16000},"max":{"x":18000,"y":12000,"z":18000}},"obstacles":[{"id":"court-island-6","min":{"x":-6000,"y":0,"z":-2000},"max":{"x":-3000,"y":2400,"z":2000}}],"actors":[{"id":"pursuit-1","type":"patrol","role":"hostile","position":{"x":-8000,"y":0,"z":-6000},"path":[],"speed":1500,"radius":350,"height":1800,"health":50,"fireEveryTicks":0,"damage":0},{"id":"pursuit-2","type":"patrol","role":"hostile","position":{"x":8000,"y":0,"z":6000},"path":[],"speed":1500,"radius":350,"height":1800,"health":50,"fireEveryTicks":0,"damage":0}],"steps":{"self-level":[{"type":"hunt-contact-v1","targets":["pursuit-1","pursuit-2"],"ordered":false,"tail":{"linksPerCatch":1,"maxLinks":32,"neckDistance":4500,"radius":350}}],"acro":[{"type":"hunt-contact-v1","targets":["pursuit-1","pursuit-2"],"ordered":false,"tail":{"linksPerCatch":1,"maxLinks":32,"neckDistance":4500,"radius":350}}]},"pursuit":{"format":"FlightPursuit.v1","nodes":[{"id":"node-1","position":{"x":-8000,"y":0,"z":6000}},{"id":"node-2","position":{"x":-8000